# Generated reveal island bundle. Produced by `npm run build:reveal` from
# src/reveal/*. Committing it caused a *stale bundle* bug: the compiled JS kept
# serving a removed Mux HLS <video> long after App.tsx had dropped it, because
# nothing forced a rebuild. Always generated, never tracked.
public/static/reveal/

# Editor duplicate artifacts (e.g. "core - Copy.js") — these shadowed real
# sources during review and must never be committed.
* - Copy.*
*\ -\ Copy.*
